<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan foreign exchange market closes for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan foreign exchange market closes for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market will be closed on Friday and Saturday for domestic holidays. The market will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Taiwan dollar ended at T$27.480 to one U.S. dollar, compared with T$27.470 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
